        "title": "Divine place- Must visit",
        "text": "A Superb place, very divine.\n\n1. Must go place if one at kathmandu\n2.Only Hindus are allowed\n3.Go in the evening , one can get a chance to be a part of the divine aarti at 7- 7:30 pm\n4.If one has a strong heart and have interest, Cremations are performed at the back side of the temple on the bank of Bagmati river, you can see it.\n5.Aghorees are also seen there.\n6. Badly restored temple.very shady entrance of the biggest temple of the country, very sad to see it.\n7. Security is very loose.\n8.You can find dogs also inside the temple.\n9.No entry fee for SAARC nationals.\n\nOne must go for shiv Shankar Shmbhu.All said and done the experience is superb.",
