        "title": "Be Considerate When Touring this Sensitive Site",
        "text": "The number of camera-toting tourists could potentially take away from the sense of sacred significance of this site, and please don't add this to your itinerary if you doubt your ability to act respectfully and without judgement.  You will likely see recently deceased being carried to the banks of the river and cremated, so not for the faint of heart.  Also, before you start snapping away on your camera, imagine what your reaction might be to foreigners showing up at a funeral of your loved one, taking photos and expressing their awe at the rituals.  Read up on Hindu beliefs on cremation beforehand to fully appreciate the ritual.",
